  "result": "All six reported problems are fixed. `tsc --noEmit` is clean and the full vitest suite passes (73 files, 617 tests).\n\nChanged files:\n- `src/server/services/activity-service.ts`: entries take the event's own time, the assignment actor is the person who assigned, issue and comment entries carry their project, and every audited event now has a handler. Exports read the whole range by following the cursor.\n- `src/server/repositories/activity-repository.ts`: metadata is stored instead of `\"{}\"`, and `until` is inclusive.\n- `src/schemas/activity.ts`: range bounds are normalised to the stored timestamp format, and a range ending before it starts is refused.\n- `src/app/api/export/activity/route.ts`: exports every entry in the range rather than the first 100.\n- `src/types/event.ts`, `src/server/services/project-service.ts`, `src/server/services/comment-service.ts`: new `project.updated` and `comment.updated` events, emitted on project and comment edits.",
